# {{.Name}}

Created by `upc new app`.

- `upc install` installs the dependencies (TypeScript and the Node types).
- `upc run dev` runs `src/main.ts` directly with Node's type stripping; `upc up` starts it in the background (port 8000, or pass one) and `upc down` stops it.
- `upc build` compiles to `dist/`; `upc run start` runs the compiled app.
- `docker compose up --build` runs it in a container (`Dockerfile`, `compose.yaml`) on 127.0.0.1:8000.
